---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import site from '../data/site.json';
---
<Base title="Privacy policy" description="How Calm Money handles your personal information.">
  <section class="privacy">
    <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
    <p class="draft"><strong>Draft for review.</strong> Have this checked before launch, and add your email platform, payment provider and analytics tool where marked.</p>

    <h2>Who we are</h2>
    <p>Calm Money is run by {site.company}. If you have any questions about your information, email <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.</p>

    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>If you join our mailing list:</strong> your name and email address.</li>
      <li><strong>If you buy or apply for the programme:</strong> your name, email address and the details you give in your application. Payments are handled by [payment provider]; we never see or store your card details.</li>
      <li><strong>When you use this website:</strong> basic, anonymous information about how the site is used, through [analytics tool].</li>
      <li><strong>The calculator:</strong> the figures you type in stay in your browser. We don’t store or see them.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>How we use it</h2>
    <p>To deliver the programme you’ve bought, to reply to you, and, if you’ve agreed, to send you emails about money and Calm Money. Every email has a link to unsubscribe.</p>

    <h2>Who we share it with</h2>
    <p>Only the services that help us run Calm Money: [email platform], [payment provider], [programme platform] and [analytics tool]. We never sell your information.</p>

    <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
    <p>For as long as you’re a member or on our mailing list, and afterwards only as long as the law requires, for example for tax records.</p>

    <h2>Your rights</h2>
    <p>You can ask to see, correct or delete your information, or object to how we use it, by emailing <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>. You can also complain to the Information Commissioner’s Office at ico.org.uk.</p>

    <h2>Not financial advice</h2>
    <p>{site.disclaimer}</p>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .privacy { max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto; padding: var(--section-gap) 28px 0; line-height: 1.65; }
  h1 { font-weight: 450; letter-spacing: -0.02em; font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 4.2vw, 3.5rem); line-height: 1.02; margin: 0 0 24px; }
  h2 { font-weight: 500; font-size: 1.3rem; margin: 36px 0 8px; }
  p, li { color: var(--muted); }
  strong { color: var(--ink); font-weight: 500; }
  ul { padding-left: 1.2em; display: grid; gap: 8px; }
  .draft { padding: 12px 16px; background: var(--mint); border-radius: 10px; }
  @media (max-width: 760px) { .privacy { padding-inline: 16px; } }
</style>
